          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nibasunga mbu Chende khukasie tsiyemi okhuyinga Yeremia; okhuba amalako shikalasikha ewomukuhani, kata obuchesiyi ewomuchesi, kata likhuwa ewomunabii ta. Chende khutsie khumuupe netsinimi, nikhurahulilakhwo akeke kosi ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
